title: "A View to a Kill: ZORIN — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  PROJECT BOND film package (A View to a Kill, 1985, mission codename ZORIN).
  Deterministic models of microchip supply-chain monopoly choke points,
  flood-the-mine water-ingress dynamics, and horse-race form / cover-risk
  analytics, wrapped in the FROZEN bond_api MissionProvider protocol.
